 "lines": [
  [
   "P1",
   "Title: Inverse of Direct Image Mapping is Direct Image Mapping of Inverse"
  ],
  [
   "P2",
   "Let $S$ and $T$ be [[Definition:Set|sets]]."
  ],
  [
   "P3",
   "Let $f :S \\to T$ be a [[Definition:Bijection|bijection]]."
  ],
  [
   "P4",
   "Let $f^\\to$ be the [[Definition:Direct Image Mapping of Mapping|direct image mapping]] of $f$."
  ],
  [
   "P5",
   "Then:"
  ],
  [
   "P6",
   ":$\\paren {f^\\to}^{-1} = \\paren {f^{-1} }^{\\to}$"
  ],
  [
   "P7",
   "where $f^{-1}$ and $\\paren{f^\\to}^{-1}$ denote the [[Definition:Inverse of Mapping|inverses]] of $f$ and $f^\\to$ respectively"
  ],
  [
   1,
   "From [[Mapping is Bijection iff Direct Image Mapping is Bijection]]:"
  ],
  [
   2,
   ":$f^\\to$ is a [[Definition:Bijection|bijection]]"
  ],
  [
   3,
   ""
  ],
  [
   4,
   "From [[Bijection has Left and Right Inverse]]:"
  ],
  [
   5,
   ":the [[Definition:Inverse Mapping|inverses]] $f^{-1}$ and $\\paren{f^\\to}^{-1}$ are [[Definition:Well-Defined|well-defined]]"
  ],
  [
   6,
   ""
  ],
  [
   7,
   "We have:"
  ],
  [
   8,
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   9,
   "{{eqn | l = f^\\to \\circ \\paren{f^{-1} }^\\to"
  ],
  [
   10,
   "      | r = \\paren{f \\circ f^{-1} }^\\to"
  ],
  [
   11,
   "      | c = [[Composition of Direct Image Mappings of Mappings]]"
  ],
  [
   12,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   13,
   "{{eqn | r = \\paren{I_S }^\\to"
  ],
  [
   14,
   "      | c = {{Defof|Inverse Mapping}}"
  ],
  [
   15,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   16,
   "{{eqn | r = I_{\\powerset S}"
  ],
  [
   17,
   "      | c = [[Direct Image Mapping of Identity is Identity]]"
  ],
  [
   18,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   19,
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   20,
   ""
  ],
  [
   21,
   "Similarly:"
  ],
  [
   22,
   "{{begin-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   23,
   "{{eqn | l = \\paren{f^{-1} }^\\to \\circ f^\\to "
  ],
  [
   24,
   "      | r = I_{\\powerset T}"
  ],
  [
   25,
   "}}"
  ],
  [
   26,
   "{{end-eqn}}"
  ],
  [
   27,
   ""
  ],
  [
   28,
   "Hence $\\paren {f^\\to}^{-1} = \\paren {f^{-1} }^{\\to}$ by definition of [[Definition:Inverse Mapping|inverse mapping]]."
  ],
  [
   29,
   "{{qed}}"
  ],
  [
   30,
   ""
  ],
